  "description": "ZIJTET crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I -4. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H108 Gd8 N28 O60. From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd5 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd6 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd7 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd8 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.797-3.875 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.51-112.64°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C64H108Gd8N28O60. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 12 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
